  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 388,
   "width": 761,
   "height": 81,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100025,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700175,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A match produces TWO executions (fills) - one per side. And the execution price is the RESTING\norder's price, not the incoming one's: a resting sell at 415.00 meeting a buy willing to pay\n420.00 trades at 415.00. The resting order established the price and holds time priority;\nthe aggressor takes what is offered. Using the incoming price would overcharge every\ncrossing order.",
   "originalText": "A match produces TWO executions (fills) - one per side. And the execution price is the RESTING\norder's price, not the incoming one's: a resting sell at 415.00 meeting a buy willing to pay\n420.00 trades at 415.00. The resting order established the price and holds time priority;\nthe aggressor takes what is offered. Using the incoming price would overcharge every\ncrossing order.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
